=2 Walkthrough
* **{c=red:Note: }**You must zone and wait until the next game day after completing the previous quest.
* Enter the palace in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens}.
* Zone into {z:Sealion's Den} for a cutscene and then speak with {n:Sueleen} to head to {z:Al'Taieu}.
** You may receive a cutscene with {n:Sueleen} if this is your first time returning to Sealion's Den since your first visit to Al'Taieu. Zone back to Tavnazian Safehold and re-enter Sealion's Den for the correct cutscene with {p:Prishe}.
* Zone into the {z:Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi} and click the entrance to {z:The Garden of Ru'Hmet} (Gate of the Gods) for a cutscene.
* Go to the {p:Empyreal Paradox} and check the Transcendental Radiance for a cutscene.
** If you have the home point Lumoria > The Garden of Ru'Hmet > #1, just zone back out to the Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, warp to the home point and descend.
** If you are on RoV you might encounter a cut scene after pressing Descend on the elevator.
* Check the Transcendental Radiance again to enter the BC against {n:Eald'narche} and {p:Kam'lanaut}.

=2 Boss Fight
* This fight was initially uncapped at level 75. Level 99 players should have little to no difficulty with this fight.
* Trusts may be summoned inside this fight.
* In this BC you fight both {p:Kam'lanaut} and his brother {n:Eald'narche} at the same time.

[Area
{p:Empyreal Paradox}
>Boss
* {p:Kam'lanaut}
* {n:Eald'narche}

>Abilities
* {p:Kam'lanaut}:
** **Light Blade:** Single-target high damage. Damage is reduced by kiting.
** En-spells : Earth Blade, Water Blade, Wind Blade, Fire Blade, Frost Blade, Lightning Blade.
*** When he uses his En-spell, nukes of the matching element heal him.
** **Great Wheel:** AoE damage and Hate Reset.
* {n:Eald'narche} is a tougher version of the stage 2 boss from {M:Zilart Mission 16|Zilart Mission 16|The Celestial Nexus}.
** **Vortex:** AoE damage {p:Terror}.
** **Stellar Burst:** AoE damage {p:Silence}.
** **Omega Javelin:** Single target damage {p:Petrification}.

>Notes
* Kam'lanaut casts various debuff spells: Silencega, Slowga, Graviga, and Dispelga.
* Gravity is difficult to land on Kam'lanaut without Elemental Seal.
* Eald'narche has approximately 5000 HP.
* Eald'narche can teleport around the arena.
* Eald'narche casts all tier III -ga nukes including Bindga and {s:Sleepga II}.
* Eald'narche resists magical damage.
* Begin by kiting {p:Kam'lanaut} while everyone else goes all out on {n:Eald'narche}.
* Stunning {n:Eald'narche}'s nukes is very helpful.

]
* See the {p:Discussion page|Talk:Apocalypse Nigh} for testimonials.

* After defeating the brothers, speak to {n:Aldo} in {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8) for a cutscene.
** You must be Rank 5 or higher in your current nation to receive this cutscene.
* Zone and wait until the next Vana'diel day after completing the battlefield, then talk to {p:Gilgamesh} in {z:Norg} for a cutscene to complete the quest.
** Changed as of the {p:November 10th, 2021 Version Update|https://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/58770} to be the next Vana'diel day.
*** Not tied to when you might have talked to Aldo.

=2 Reacquisition
* Follow this if you chose the wrong earring or want to get a different one.
* Drop your earring and proceed to the {p:Empyreal Paradox} (must be dropped before you zone into {p:Empyreal Paradox}).
** The fastest way there is via the {p:Home Point} warp if you have it. Lumoria > The Garden of Ru'Hmet > #1 and descend.
* Select the ??? near the entrance and erase your memories; "I've already forgotten them" and "Yes, erase my memories".
* Recomplete {q:Shadows of the Departed|Shadows of the Departed|Shadows of the Departed} and Apocalypse Nigh to re-obtain an earring of your choice.

